WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:05.020
How could DA have possibly come
from the same roots as Antiskill?

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.190
They may be the same roots,
but theirs have gone rotten.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:11.440
Th-They're... Nakimoto's cleaners?

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.740
Where are you headed, out-of-season Santa?

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:23.870
That's the huge bag with the girl
in it they mentioned over the radio.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.580
Damn it, I'm getting it from all sides.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.670
But then, it's just what
I need to help with my rehab.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:53.530
"A Certain Scientific Accelerator"

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:04.430
"#06 Scavenger (Corpse-Eating Squad)"

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:11.990
It only took the four of them to
bring down that multi-legged weapon.

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:15.570
There is no record of these
four in the esper database.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.530
Why aren't they coming up?

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.140
They may be a dark-side organization.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:34.090
Those are some bonus points.
If we recover the girl in the bag,

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:35.880
I can guarantee some additional compensation.

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.340
Let's see you in action.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.430
Okay, here we go!

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:47.390
Let's see how well...

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.270
...this goes today!

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.200
In the zone!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.330
Hey, Naru!

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.450
Watch it, will you?! Hold back a little more!

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:11.620
Oh, sorry, sorry!
I get a little too excited, you see!

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.190
Every time I think I get to kill a teacher!

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.640
Now then, how should I kill her?

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:27.350
Mess around by pulling her arms out
of her shoulders one at a time?

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:30.140
I'm not your toy.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:34.520
Or maybe I'll snap her 
neck, and let her twitch!

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:38.280
--Like I said, I'm not your toy.
--Take that!

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.210
Which would you like?

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.520
Why do you have such a 
beef against educators?

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:47.160
Educators? Oh, you mean teachers?

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:48.160
Yeah.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:52.410
I mean, you guys are the
root of all the evil, aren't you?

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.500
Mm-hmm. Everyone knows that.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.670
Academy City is like one big school.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:03.760
So it's obviously the teachers' fault
if the city isn't run right, isn't it?

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:07.970
Which is why, if we drop 
the hammer one by one

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:10.270
on the teachers who neglect their duties
and let the city get this bad,

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:13.100
then someday, we'll arrive at
the headmaster or the principal

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.190
or whoever the source of the evil is,

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:21.000
and after we squash them nice and flat,
we think it will be a better place.

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.720
Don't you think so?

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:24.700
You think so, too, right?

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.260
Mm-hmm.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:27.870
You're wrong!

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:32.790
Sure, there are people like DA here.
But those of us in Antiskill

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:35.750
have the resolve and the determination

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.570
to risk our necks to keep
the students of Academy City safe!

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:44.760
There are teachers like that?

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.390
Of course not!

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:47.300
Yeah, no way.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.770
You rotten scum!

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:56.940
You kids should listen and
do what we grown-ups tell you!

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.560
Die, you filthy brat!

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.280
A DA survivor?

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.240
So, a former teacher.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:10.200
It's pretty low to be shooting
at students, no questions asked.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:14.040
--Yeah. There really is no helping teachers.
--Damn... Damn...

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:25.090
Yaku, would you finish him off?

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:26.840
Yeah, okay.

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:27.910
Get out of there!

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.020
Wh-What is this?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.770
Minus 269 degrees.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.200
My own specially-formulated refrigerant.

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:46.200
I can still... b-bring justice...

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.450
Controlling the specific
gravity here is the key point.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:53.020
J-Justice... to this city...

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:55.950
Bye-bye!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:03.800
Why...?

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:05.560
Sorry to keep you.

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:08.760
Now it's your turn, teacher.

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.890
Run. Take her with you.

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.270
I'm counting on you!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:22.310
That thing is meaningless against me!

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.820
Huotou! Don't let her get killed!

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:32.530
Acknowledged.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.580
Bye-bye, teacher!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:50.340
All you've done is interfere with us!
Who are you, anyway?

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:54.660
Do we have us an honor student
who's here to help the teacher?

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.680
She seems different than any ordinary esper.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:02.310
Honor students should know
that they have to wait their turn!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:05.020
Naru, kill the honor student.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.230
The teacher comes first.

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.320
Oh, butt out of this!
<i>I'm</i> the one who's doing it!

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:11.020
The honor student comes first.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:15.410
That will ensure the teacher
can die in despair, won't it?

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.120
Gotcha!

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:19.090
Huotou!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.790
Adonai, acknowledged.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:24.690
Greatly revising upward
combat strength estimate.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:28.010
Releasing muscle strength
to carry out elimination.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:31.370
Muscle tissue rupture tolerance at 10%.

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.120
Roughly ten minutes of 
combat will be possible.

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:37.890
Now starting.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:48.190
You sneaky little...!

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:55.910
You leave my work of art alone!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:05.460
This awesomely cool mascot suit of mine

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:08.090
can shapeshift between defense and offense!

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.550
Are those paper charms? No, something else.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:15.180
Her psychokinetically-imbued paper
has the hardness of tungsten alloy

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.760
combined with the flexibility of fabric.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:22.230
Paired with her twisted
modeling style and fighting sense,

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.310
her practical combat skill is second to none.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.980
I'm gonna skewer you!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:34.820
Huotou!

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:36.820
Take this!

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:41.620
You're dead!

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:42.370
Huotou!

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:47.380
Adonai, there is no problem.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:48.990
Huotou...

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:52.670
It's hopeless. The way things
are headed, Huotou will be beaten.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.260
I can bolster her strength using magic,

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:56.790
but in her current shape...

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:01.930
Physical injury level 4.
Revising combat-capable time downward.

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:05.600
Heh, the honor student is a real trouper.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:11.400
I have to save Huotou. Think!
There must be... There must be something...

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.070
Okay, here I come!

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:22.750
This should do it!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.660
To finish you off, a Giant Stamp!

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:32.300
Flattened!

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.840
She's dead for sure this time.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:35.510
Naru?

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.550
That stings...!

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.900
Wh-What is that?!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:51.710
Armor of the Dead.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:57.820
She's a psychokinesist, like Naru,
who can use dirt as a medium?

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.700
Damn it! Do you think something like that

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:04.200
can stop my specially-made
mascot suit's attack?!

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:07.160
Killer Punch!

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.130
That stings again!

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:15.840
It's no use. I don't know who you people are,

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.880
but I've just about reached
the limits of my patience.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.300
Get out of here!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:21.010
No way. Nyah!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:22.470
Good grief.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:25.080
Naru, wear her down. It's just dirt.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:29.100
Mankind has dug holes in every
kind of earth, no matter how hard.

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.980
Oh, that makes sense!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.300
My new creation...

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.280
...is an excavator version!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.690
Hey, don't run away!

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.430
Why, you... You...!

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.840
Stop running away!

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.850
This time I've got you!

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:09.600
I'm getting dizzy...!

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:20.110
It looks like it's hard for her to control
such a complicated component.

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:25.010
It would kill with one shot, but for
as unimaginative as it is, it's avoidable.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.620
So we need some bait to catch her with.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.960
Naru, go after the blond!

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:30.830
Huh?

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:31.870
Just do it!

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.840
No good. I can't move right now.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.670
Say your prayers!

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:50.750
Huotou?!

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:52.980
She took the bait.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:56.730
Oh, my first hit! Now to keep it rolling!

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.690
Speed up!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.190
Huotou, stop!

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:05.370
This is not a problem. 
Adonai, please run away.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.670
Huotou, don't do this.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:11.540
Adonai, your safety is my first priority.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:15.130
Ah, I hate grade-grubbers.

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.090
Increasing rotation!

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:29.890
Enough... Stop, already...

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.940
I'm begging you, please stop!

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:35.650
--Not...
--Not...

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.310
--...a...
--...chance!

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:41.440
How? How can you do something like this?

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:44.490
Hmm... For justice, maybe?

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:48.200
This isn't justice.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:52.570
Oh, I see. Your kind of justice
and our kind of justice is different.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:54.500
Not that it really matters.

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:56.250
Back to work.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:13:02.210
Okay, first I kill the honor student,
and after that, the teacher!

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:07.970
Then finally, you. Lose all hope in
this world before going on to the next.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:10.430
Why...?

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:20.270
Why is the world full of nothing but despair?

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.530
Mm, it's all the teachers' fault.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.530
Which is why...

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:33.620
I'm going to make sure to kill you all!

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:41.500
You're finished now!

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:00.980
Wh-Who is that?!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:01.700
Naru!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.440
What?!

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:07.200
For Pete's sake,

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:11.220
go play "school arts festival" by yourself.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.690
Otherwise...

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:21.250
...you'll get people like me dropping by.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:26.550
Nice. What a lovely face.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.430
A look in his eye that's
part killer, part crazy,

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:33.060
and a skewed mouth that's all but
grown desperate toward the world.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:36.080
Mm-hmm, I'm also getting
the same whiff from him.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:42.270
Nice going! What do you say you
come along on our teacher-hunting trip?

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:46.460
Ugh, Leader's dreadful taste
is kicking in again.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.860
Naru, are you okay?

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:52.280
She takes a little interest in someone,
and then can't help but invite them in.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:55.200
Naru, you weren't hurt that badly.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.920
So, what do you say? I'm sure it will be fun!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.460
Thank you for saving all of us.

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:05.500
You're in the way.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:05.920
Huh?

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:09.250
Take them and get lost, now.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:10.590
Right.

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:17.140
Hey, you there! With you along,
there will be exactly five of us,

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:20.800
and I'll even give you what would
be the black position in a sentai show!

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:24.530
That's appealing, right? How about it?

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:29.070
Hey, come on, stop ignoring me!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:29.820
Tch.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:31.360
Say something, would you?!

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.910
Something, eh?

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:50.340
"Some-thing-would-you."

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:53.050
Huh?

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.300
What?

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:59.480
You just told me to say 
something, didn't you?!

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:08.230
A bug is about to be smashed by a bug!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.340
--Leader!
--Leader!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.620
Wh-Who is this guy?

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:23.920
He's bad news.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:26.000
Time for a tactical retreat?

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:29.130
If we do that, we'll get demoted!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:30.380
Then what do we do?

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:34.090
Yeah! My techniques don't work against him!

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:37.160
Ah! I can't take you two complaining!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.310
We'll use a combination attack.

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:40.020
--Huh?
--Huh?

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:44.770
Nobody has ever escaped from
a Scavenger combo attack. Am I right?

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:48.570
We are the unbeatable...

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.280
...Scavenger!

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:54.760
Hey! We're not done yet!

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:06.580
Good. He can't move from there
if there's no frictional coefficient.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:07.460
Naru!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.550
Burst of Artwork!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.680
There, all done!

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:23.140
Yaku!

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.740
Oh, the honor student guys are back.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:41.530
They're too late. He's already inside there.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:44.200
A liquid thermite reaction.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:47.580
The heat released from such
a reaction reaches 4,000 degrees.

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:50.920
My guess is that there won't
even be any bone fragments left.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:53.710
Oh--Oh, no...

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:58.270
The Iron Maiden--a fitting end
for a wanton criminal.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.930
Now, the teacher is next.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.470
We have to crush the teacher pest.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.070
Begging for your life won't help.

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:09.660
"Teacher" this, "teacher"
that--give it a rest, already.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.070
As of right now, <i>I'm</i> the teacher.

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:20.530
I'll teach you the right way to be a villain.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.620
S-Seriously?!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.830
Our combination was perfect.

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:25.750
This isn't possible.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:27.710
Who exactly is this guy?

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.460
Accelerator!

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:31.420
"Accelerator"?

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:33.460
I've heard of him before.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.660
White complexion...

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:37.660
White hair...

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:39.390
Red eyes...

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:45.180
Y-You're telling me he's the...
f-f-first-ranked?!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.810
This is the ability of a Level 5?

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:56.240
Hey, are you already out 
of your little tricks?

00:18:56.240 --> 00:19:01.080
What are you looking at me like that for?
You're starting to bring me down.

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:11.570
Celebrate! I've found a nice bed for you!

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:20.930
Did you know that human bodies
have something called bioelectricity?

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:24.810
I'm going to tweak yours
just a little bit. Enjoy!

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:33.360
At least look like you're having fun.
I guess you can't, huh?

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:37.320
This bed doesn't look
too comfortable to sleep in.

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:39.210
How dare he do that to Seike?!

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:40.780
Leader, your instructions!

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:42.030
We have to defeat him!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:45.370
You bastard!

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:46.170
Naru, wait!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.790
What do we do? What <i>can</i> we do?

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:52.080
Die!!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:59.880
We're supposed to defeat the 1st-ranked?!

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:01.220
Tch.

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:03.930
That was no fun.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.640
No, no fun.

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:11.480
A cheap trick like that...

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:17.440
...won't work against me.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:18.690
Naru!

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:21.320
Leader, Seike and Naru are...

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:26.660
Accelerator... The greatest esper
in all of Academy City...

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.790
His ability is vector manipulation...

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:33.260
--He can freely control the direction
of every kind of power in the world...

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:34.460
--Snap out of it! The two of us
have to do something about him!

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:35.670
Leader!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.750
Did I go and break her brain?

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:43.380
Too slow.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:57.130
That just leaves you.

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:03.280
Bad as I am, it's not my style
to pick on defenseless kids.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:07.110
So, what to do...?

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:14.430
Huh? Come on, say something, would you?

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:24.680
Imagine, a little kid walking
around down here, wetting her pants.

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.680
Of the 2.3 million people in Academy City,
seven of them are Level 5s.

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:34.690
Running into one is like
winning the worst-case lottery.

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:40.060
No bonus, and our fee from
our clients will inevitably be reduced.

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:45.620
Tch.

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:47.610
Accelerator!

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:48.200
Huh?

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:57.130
Is it over already?

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:02.860
Damn, that wasn't very
much rehab at all, was it?

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:36.960
"Next time"

00:23:36.960 --> 00:23:41.530
"Download"
